    <unit id="SemanticBodyDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>Body element with padding, background color and text styles for the panel content area; it materializes on first expansion.</source>
        <target state="translated">内容元素，包含内边距、背景色、文字样式等面板内容区域的展示样式；首次展开时才会物化。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="SemanticHeaderDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>Header element with padding, background color, font size, line height and cursor style for the panel header</source>
        <target state="translated">头部元素，包含内边距、背景色、字号、行高、光标样式等面板头部的样式</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="SemanticIconDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>Icon element with icon size, placement, margin and rotation transforms for the expand/collapse arrow</source>
        <target state="translated">图标元素，包含图标尺寸、位置、边距、旋转变换等展开收起箭头的样式</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="SemanticPartStyleDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>Use owner-scoped selectors and Expander property selectors to customize the published Semantic Parts.</source>
        <target state="translated">使用 owner 作用域选择器和 Expander 属性选择器定制已发布的 Semantic Part。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
